    "description": "The global GFDL SPEAR large ensemble climate change simulations were produced by a 30-member ensemble over the period of 1921-2100. The SPEAR climate model was run using historical radiative forcing from 1921 to 2014 and SSP5-8.5 projected radiative forcings for 2015-2100.\nHMA users might be particularly interested in near-surface air temperature and precipitation data within this larger collection of model output variables.",
